    "text": "fallriverreporter.com\nwebsite\nBangor\nNew Bedford man wanted on list of charges and released on bond located in Maine\nBy Ken Paiva,\n2 hours agoPortland, ME – The U.S. Marshals Service in Maine, announce the arrest of 32-year-old Jameel T. Clark White of New Bedford, in Bangor, Maine. Clark-White was sought on multiple warrants for drug possession, possession of machine gun, x3 counts of possession large capacity firearm, carrying loaded firearm without a license, firearm violation with 3 prior violent drug crimes, carrying firearm on school grounds, receiving stolen property, leaving the scene of property damage accident, and operating a motor vehicle with license suspended. All warrants were issued out of the State of Massachusetts.",
